<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>LET THE WORLD BURN (with G-Eazy &amp; Ari Abdul) - Remix</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Chris Grey, G-Eazy, Ari Abdul</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LET THE WORLD BURN (with G-Eazy &amp; Ari Abdul) [Remix]</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5wNDRMkoysXZGiW4ja5Tik</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.510" end="00:09.360">The way you look at me is fatal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.360" end="00:16.160">You're not an angel, baby, you're Armageddon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.160" end="00:19.650">But I could follow you for miles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.650" end="00:24.910">Deep in a spiral, it's crazy, I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.910" end="00:29.970">I shouldn't have fallen in love, look what it made me become</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.970" end="00:34.820">I let you get too close, just to wake up alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.820" end="00:40.290">And I know you think you can run, you're scared to believe I'm the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.290" end="00:45.330">But I just can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.330" end="00:48.120">I'd let the world burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.120" end="00:50.870">Let the world burn for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.870" end="00:53.990">This is how it always had to end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.990" end="00:56.800">If I can't have you, then no one can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.800" end="00:59.010">I'd let it burn (burn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.010" end="01:01.320">I'd let the world burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.320" end="01:04.920">Just to hear you callin' out my name (young Gerald)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.920" end="01:07.800">Watchin' it all go down in flames (uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.800" end="01:10.390">Not enough money in the world that could change us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.390" end="01:12.760">Demons in the basement, I gotta keep 'em chained up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.760" end="01:15.760">Words get exchanged, cursin' my name (cursin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.760" end="01:17.840">Closet full of skeletons, it's time to get 'em cleaned up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.840" end="01:20.310">Doused in the gas 'til we burst into flames</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.310" end="01:22.870">Cursed by the fame, buyin' purses and rings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.870" end="01:25.310">Hoppin' off of planes then we swerve in the lanes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.310" end="01:28.020">Search for solutions to get cured from the pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.020" end="01:30.440">Yayo and a yayho, pass me a cup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.440" end="01:33.040">I was at the afters plastered as fuck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.040" end="01:35.510">Girls packed in, but I'm passin' 'em up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.510" end="01:38.350">Told you the truth and I'm backin' it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.350" end="01:41.080">There once was a time when all we had was our trust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.080" end="01:43.330">Lose it all every time the madness erupts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.330" end="01:45.860">Charlie, go ahead and buy a casket for us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.860" end="01:47.950">Caught fire, that's what I get for gassin' you up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.950" end="01:50.190">I'd let the world burn (burn it down)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.190" end="01:52.920">Let the world burn for you (whoa)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.920" end="01:55.560">This is how it always had to end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.560" end="01:58.370">If I can't have you, then no one can (uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.370" end="02:03.450">I'd let it burn, I'd let the world burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.450" end="02:06.360">Just to hear you callin' out my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.360" end="02:10.000">Watchin' it all go down in flames (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.000" end="02:12.570">I'd let it burn, scorchin' the Earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.570" end="02:15.130">'Til it's all cavin' in (cavin' in)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.130" end="02:17.800">I'd let it burn, baby, we're cursed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.800" end="02:20.170">Tell me you're feelin' it (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.170" end="02:22.450">I'd let it burn, scorchin' the Earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.450" end="02:25.430">'Til it's all cavin' in (cavin' in)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.430" end="02:28.500">Tell me you're feelin' it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.500" end="02:31.360">I'd let the world burn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.360" end="02:34.110">Let the world burn for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.110" end="02:37.070">This is how it always had to end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.070" end="02:41.450">If I can't have you, then no one can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.450" end="02:45.450" /></div></body></tt>